{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "Safety", "depth": 1, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feels unsafe out there.", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 111}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I could've avoided it, but it's gotten bad out there.", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Feels really unsafe.", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But lately, it's like everyone is just not paying attention.", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 100}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "I just want to feel secure when I'm driving.", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 142}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "I just want to feel safe and respected when I'm driving.", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 195}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "last week that merge nearly cost me, and yesterday, texting while driving? Ridiculous. Just wish people would respect the road.", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 161}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just worried about all these reckless drivers.", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 62}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, same old. Just worried about all these reckless drivers.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 62}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "People aren't respecting each other out there.", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 102}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I just want to feel safe when I'm driving.", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I just wish people would follow the basics.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Everyone needs to be more alert, you know?", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feeling really unsafe lately.", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 124}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261003T000844Z", "last_updated_at": "20261003T002117Z", "first_seen_session": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "last_session": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "Acknowledgment of Effort", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just dealt with a really rude driver.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 61}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just dealt with a really rude driver. Nearly crashed, you know?", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 87}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's been like that for years.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "That one merge without signaling... I could've avoided it, but it's gotten bad out there. Feels like no respect for others.", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 135}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's been like that for years. Safety was always a top priority for me when I learned to drive.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, same. That one merge without signaling... I could've avoided it, but it's gotten bad out there.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, same old. Just worried about all these reckless drivers.Feels like every time I hit the road, I'm dodging something.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 122}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Thanks for checking in.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 110}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Thanks for being here.", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 85}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Meh, same old, just paranoid every time I hit the road.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 55}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Someone merged without signaling last week, almost got me.", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "But until then, I need to keep my guard up.", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 100}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "It’s just really frustrating. I guess I just need to stay alert and hope for the best on the road.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "But I guess that's the new normal until things improve.", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 133}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261003T000844Z", "last_updated_at": "20261003T002507Z", "first_seen_session": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "last_session": "p000232-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
